  Hub-->>GHA: prior notes
  GHA->>GHA: assemble prompt + diff
  GHA->>Hermes: hermes -z
  Hermes->>OR: completions
  OR-->>Hermes: review markdown
  Hermes-->>GHA: final text
  GHA->>Hub: publish memory + run
  GHA->>PR: review comment + artifacts
